#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Sidralune {0} — an integrated astronomy suite for planning, observing, imaging and science."
msgstr "Sidralune {0} — një paketë astronomike e integruar për planifikim, vëzhgim, imazhe dhe shkencë."

#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Algorithms: IAU 2006 precession and nutation, JPL DE440 (SPK) or Standish/ELP2000 analytic ephemerides, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nKrisciunas & Schaefer sky brightness, Schaefer visual thresholds, triangle-invariant star matching with RANSAC, TAN-SIP WCS,\nstacking with kappa-sigma, winsorized, linear-fit and generalized-ESD rejection, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy with total variation (Dey et al.), starlet wavelets (Starck & Murtagh), generalized hyperbolic stretch,\nmulti-point lucky imaging, spherical planetary derotation, generalised Lomb-Scargle, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, Mandel-Agol-type transit model with ensemble MCMC."
msgstr "Algoritmet: precesioni dhe nutacioni IAU 2006, efemeridat JPL DE440 (SPK) ose analitike Standish/ELP2000, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nshkëlqimi i qiellit Krisciunas & Schaefer, pragjet vizuale Schaefer, përputhja e yjeve e pandryshueshme ndaj trekëndëshave me RANSAC, TAN-SIP WCS,\nmbledhja me refuzim kappa-sigma, winsorized, me përshtatje lineare dhe ESD të përgjithësuar, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy me variacion total (Dey e të tjerë), valëzat starlet (Starck & Murtagh), shtrirja hiperbolike e përgjithësuar,\nlucky imaging me shumë pika, derotacioni sferik i planetëve, Lomb-Scargle i përgjithësuar, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, model tranziti i tipit Mandel-Agol me MCMC të grupit."

#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Data © their providers: JPL/NASA, Minor Planet Center, HYG Database (D. Nash), OpenNGC (M. Verga), Stellarium, CDS (SIMBAD/VizieR), AAVSO, CelesTrak."
msgstr "Të dhënat © ofruesit e tyre: JPL/NASA, Minor Planet Center, HYG Database (D. Nash), OpenNGC (M. Verga), Stellarium, CDS (SIMBAD/VizieR), AAVSO, CelesTrak."

